OL,3,AFive Australian rules footy players
OL,4,Asuspended amid police investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspension comes after detectives
OL,7,Fin Melbourne began an investigation
OL,8,Finto an alleged sexual assault, said to
OL,9,Fhave to taken place in the early hours
OL,10,Fof Monday morning at the Pullman Hotel
OL,11,Fwhere the players were staying after
OL,12,Fthe match.
OL,14,FNone of the players have been arrested
OL,15,For charged in the investigation.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
